WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
Anika: The writer endpoint now resolves to ledger-two.

2
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:07.152
Lukas: Did existing connection pools refresh their targets?

3
00:00:07.152 --> 00:00:12.263
Raj: Yes, controlled reconnects. No blind request replay.

4
00:00:12.263 --> 00:00:17.087
Hannah: Use idempotency keys for any uncertain retry.

5
00:00:17.087 --> 00:00:20.735
Priya: Just to confirm, staged rollout, right?

6
00:00:20.735 --> 00:00:24.959
Anika: One tenant first. The smoke test passed.

7
00:00:24.959 --> 00:00:29.711
Lukas: Okay, compare accepted requests against durable orders.

8
00:00:29.711 --> 00:00:32.662
Raj: We'll keep an eye on queue age.

9
00:00:32.662 --> 00:00:36.070
Hannah: Maybe slower draining will buy us time.

10
00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:40.150
Priya: Yes, expand only while those checks remain clean.

